      al: "UC's official British-system requirement: complete at least 5 IGCSE/GCSE/GCE O-Levels and at least 3 academic GCE A-Level exams; report subjects and grades on the International Exams page, including the grade from each sitting if you sat a subject more than once. No minimum A-Level grades are published."
