      icse: "UC's India requirement names 'state board or CBSE' examinations — ICSE/ISC are not named separately in it, and no CISCE-specific threshold is published. Read the India rule as UC states it: complete both Year X and Year XII board examinations with average marks above 60, and report subjects and marks on the International Exams page. Berkeley publishes no higher ISC-specific percentage.",
